00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,190
谢谢你们过来
Thank you so much for coming.

36
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:19,330
-很高兴再见到你们  -谢谢
- Good to see you again. - Thank you.

37
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:20,200
谢谢
Thanks.

38
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,930
-我们打烊了  -我们得关上灯
- We're closed. - We need to kill the lights.

39
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:43,670
-你怎么知道灯开着  -我说我们打烊了
- How do you even know they're on? - Hey, I said we're closed!

40
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:44,960
我们得找个藏身之处
We need to stay off the streets.

41
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:47,360
那就换个地方  我要叫警察了
Well, stay off them somewhere else. I'll call the police.

42
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:50,020
不行  你会让警察身处险境
You can't do that. You'd be putting the cops in danger.

43
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:52,540
-我先让你身处险境  -我不想解释了
- I'll put you in danger. - I'm done explaining this.

44
00:00:56,920 --> 00:00:58,280
这是干吗
What are you doing?

45
00:00:58,540 --> 00:00:59,430
她很强壮
She is very strong.

46
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,900
先生  这是为了保护你
Sir, this is for your protection.

47
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,430
我们得让这家店看起来关门了
We need this place to look closed.

48
00:01:02,430 --> 00:01:03,630
确实关门了
It is closed!

49
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:05,900
我们不会伤害你的
We have no intention of hurting you.

50
00:01:05,910 --> 00:01:08,150
-你会说中文  -当然了
- You speak Chinese? - You can trust us.

51
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:09,400
我还是听到霓虹灯的声音
I still hear neon.

52
00:01:10,310 --> 00:01:11,710
谁会听见"霓虹灯的声音"
Who hears neon?

53
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:14,030
这位半瞎不瞎的律师
My blind-but-maybe-not lawyer.

54
00:01:14,030 --> 00:01:15,640
什么  什么叫他瞎了
You're what? What do you mean he's blind?

55
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,740
我不知道
I don't know.

56
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:19,790
我以为他是来监视我的  现在我不确定了
I thought he was sent to spy on me, and now I'm not so sure.

57
00:01:19,790 --> 00:01:22,670
-你觉得他是我们这边的  -什么这边
- You think he's on our side? - Our side of what?

58
00:01:24,070 --> 00:01:26,740
-那个耍空手道的是谁  -丹尼·兰德
- Who's Karate Kid? - Danny Rand.

59
00:01:26,740 --> 00:01:27,910
那个亿万富翁
Boy billionaire?

60
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:29,310
他脑子不太灵光
He's a little off in the head,

61
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:32,590
不过关键时刻  能打出漂亮的右勾拳
but he packs a mean right hook when it counts.

62
00:01:32,710 --> 00:01:33,690
你也是
So do you.

63
00:01:34,570 --> 00:01:35,370
你还好吗
You okay?

64
00:01:36,050 --> 00:01:38,940
-现在吗  还是大体上  -都算
- Now, or in general? - Both.

65
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:42,580
我还活着  你呢
Well, I'm alive. You?

66
00:01:43,180 --> 00:01:45,060
刚回到现实世界
Just getting back into the world.

67
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:47,350
-从哪儿  -监狱
- From where? - Prison.

68
00:01:48,290 --> 00:01:50,160
我们过会儿再谈
Yeah, we'll... we'll talk about it later.

69
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,350
你怎么到这的
How'd you end up here?

70
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:53,550
-我在办一个案子  -是吗
- I'm working a case. - Yeah?

71
00:01:53,990 --> 00:01:55,590
进展怎么样
How's that going for you so far?

72
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:58,280
后门安全  所有出口都锁上了
All right, back door is clear. Everything's locked.

73
00:01:59,050 --> 00:01:59,840
我们暂时安全了
I think we're safe for now.

74
00:02:00,660 --> 00:02:03,290
-我们就在这等着吗  -你有更好的计划吗
- So we're just gonna wait it out here? - You got a better plan?

75
00:02:03,290 --> 00:02:04,670
有什么办法让我拿回围巾吗
Is there a plan where I get my scarf back?

76
00:02:04,670 --> 00:02:06,070
等这一切结束就还给你
I just need it till this is over.

77
00:02:07,790 --> 00:02:09,889
-你们认识对方  -对
- What, do you two know each other? - Yeah.

78
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,290
怎么认识的
How?

79
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:16,390
我们偶遇  喝醉  我朝他脑袋蹦了一枪
We met. We drank. I shot him in the head.

80
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,080
你怎么还戴着那玩意
Why are you still wearing that thing?

81
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:20,400
-这...  -好了  他说我们可以留下
- It's-- - Okay. He says we can stay.

82
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:22,520
-你跟他说了什么  -我只是亮出了黑卡
- What did you tell him? - Uh, I just gave him my black card,

83
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,310
答应他付半年的房租
agreed to pay the rent for the next six months.

84
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,990
-我是丹尼  -杰西卡
- Hey, I'm, uh... I'm Danny. - Jessica.

85
00:02:28,850 --> 00:02:31,770
-你是...  -不  我不来这一套
- And, uh... you are? - No, I can't. I'm not doing this.

86
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:33,060
-哪一套  -不管刚才发生了什么
- Doing what? - Whatever happened back there,

87
00:02:33,060 --> 00:02:34,770
我们是万不得已  我们活着逃出来了
we did what we had to. We got out alive.

88
00:02:34,770 --> 00:02:36,570
我们越少了解彼此  这样越好
The less we know about each other, the better.

89
00:02:36,580 --> 00:02:38,510
-事态已经太过头了  -好了
- This is... It's too much already. - Okay.

90
00:02:38,510 --> 00:02:39,860
-别  -天啊
- Don't-- - Jesus.

91
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:41,920
-我有需要保护的人  -你不是一个人
- There are people I need to protect... - You're not the only one.

92
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:44,090
刚跟我们交手的组织很强大的
...and the organization we just fought are powerful.

93
00:02:44,090 --> 00:02:46,470
-是吗  他们是谁  -他们自称为手和会
- Yeah, who are they? - They call themselves the Hand.

94
00:02:47,050 --> 00:02:49,500
-那真正的名字呢  -不  他说得对
- What are they really called? - No, he's... he's right.

95
00:02:49,910 --> 00:02:51,370
你之前遇到过他们
You crossed paths with them before?

96
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:52,700
-对  -什么时候
- Yeah. - When?

97
00:02:53,420 --> 00:02:55,530
-这不重要  -不重要个屁
- It doesn't matter. - Bullshit it doesn't matter.

98
00:02:55,530 --> 00:02:57,540
-我同意  -我们得想清楚下一步怎么办
- Yeah, I'm with her. - We need to figure out our next move.

99
00:02:57,540 --> 00:02:59,100
不  没有下一步
No. There's no next move.

100
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:02,020
也没有"我们"  他们追杀我们  我们逃脱
And there is no "We." They came at us, we fought our way out.

101
00:03:02,020 --> 00:03:03,980
这叫职业礼仪  就这样
Let's call it professional courtesy. End of story.

102
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:05,100
事情没那么简单
Look, it's not that simple.

103
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:08,030
-这些人很危险  -我也是
- These people, they're dangerous. - So am I.

104
00:03:08,110 --> 00:03:11,410
谁快点告诉我手和会到底是怎么回事
Now, somebody tell me what I need to know about the Hand,

105
00:03:11,410 --> 00:03:13,020
好让我快点上路
so I can be on my way.

106
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,120
那是什么
What is that?

107
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,260
那是...
Oh. Um, as, uh...

108
00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:19,350
协议的一部分  他给我做了四人份的菜
as part of the deal, he made me order four of everything.

109
00:03:19,390 --> 00:03:20,870
我们不是来吃饭的
We're not here to eat.

110
00:03:22,490 --> 00:03:25,100
-那是猪肉吗  -不  是虾
- Uh, are those pork? - No, they're shrimp.

111
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:29,050
-这个人端的是猪肉  -太好了
- Oh. This guy's got pork. - Ah, great!

112
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:31,530
天啊  你真怪
God, you're weird.

113
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:35,560
手和会是个古老的犯罪组织
The Hand is an ancient criminal organization.

114
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,420
有多老
Define ancient.

115
00:03:37,420 --> 00:03:39,810
-他们永远存在  -你想再尝一口吗
- They live forever. - You wanna try that again?

116
00:03:39,810 --> 00:03:41,570
他们信奉狂热信仰
They live by a fanatical ideology,

117
00:03:41,570 --> 00:03:43,030
并且每个成员都誓死保卫它
and every member is willing to die to protect it.

118
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,550
-所以他们是恐怖分子  -不
- So they're terrorists? - No.

119
00:03:44,550 --> 00:03:45,820
恐怖分子想让全世界知道他们的行径
Terrorists want the world to know what they're doing.

120
00:03:45,820 --> 00:03:48,440
而他们更隐秘  更邪恶
This is something more secret, more evil.

121
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:49,560
他们遍布全球
And they're global.

122
00:03:49,810 --> 00:03:51,930
-他们具体做什么  -什么都做
- So what do they do? - Everything.

123
00:03:51,930 --> 00:03:53,680
包括在哈莱姆招募年轻人
Including the recruitment of young men in Harlem?

124
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,530
显然
Apparently.

125
00:03:54,530 --> 00:03:56,440
他们来纽约是有原因的  但我不知道是什么
They're in New York for a reason, but I don't know why.

126
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,350
-"狂热信仰"是什么意思  -真离谱
- What do you mean, "Fanatical ideology"? - Gonna sound crazy--

127
00:03:58,350 --> 00:04:00,450
-他们想要什么  -永生
- What do they want? - Immortality.

128
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:03,340
他们想在全世界各个阶层掌控权利  树立威信
They want power and influence at every level across the world.

129
00:04:05,060 --> 00:04:06,520
他们可能想要我
And I think they want me.

130
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,840
-为了你的钱  -不
- For your money? - No.

131
00:04:10,130 --> 00:04:11,580
我是不朽铁拳
I'm the Immortal Iron Fist.

132
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,040
什么玩意
Come again?

133
00:04:13,250 --> 00:04:14,830
昆仑的忠实守护者
Sworn protector of K'un-Lun.

134
00:04:15,170 --> 00:04:16,269
你嗑什么了  锂盐吗
What are you on? Lithium?

135
00:04:16,269 --> 00:04:18,510
那个拿剑的女人是谁
So, who was the woman with the swords?

136
00:04:18,779 --> 00:04:22,100
我不确定  不过我在柬埔寨和她交过手
Look, I'm not sure, but I fought her in Cambodia.

137
00:04:22,100 --> 00:04:23,430
对  她在我家门口出现过
Yeah, and she showed up at my doorstep.

138
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:25,130
她就是那个追杀你客户的人
She's the one that came after your client?

139
00:04:25,130 --> 00:04:27,090
对  你认识她
Yeah. Why? Do you know her?

140
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:30,280
-不  -她肯定知道自己在做什么
- No. - Well, she sure knew what she was doing.

141
00:04:30,610 --> 00:04:32,180
手和会把打手训练得冷酷无情
The Hand trains fighters to be merciless.

142
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:34,690
但不管她是谁  她跟他们不是一类人
But whoever she was, man, she was something else.

143
00:04:34,690 --> 00:04:36,860
-抱歉  这就是个错误  我得走了  -去哪
- I'm sorry. This is a mistake. I gotta go. - Where?

144
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:38,290
我不能掺和进来
I can't be a part of this.

145
00:04:38,290 --> 00:04:39,750
要我说  你已经掺和进来了
If you ask me, you already are.

146
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:40,820
我们得把一切摊开说
We need to put it all on the table.

147
00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:42,130
我不认识你  我不欠你...
I don't know you. I don't owe you any...

148
00:04:42,130 --> 00:04:43,090
我不信任你
I don't trust you.

149
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,330
你要不要把手从我肩膀上拿开
You wanna take your hand off my shoulder?

150
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,760
摘了你的面具
Take off the mask.

151
00:04:52,070 --> 00:04:53,680
你不会喜欢事情的走向的
You're not gonna like where this is heading.

152
00:04:54,950 --> 00:04:55,890
试试看
Try me.

153
00:04:56,410 --> 00:05:00,060
天呐  律师  说句话
Oh, boy. Counselor, a word?

154
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,760
你想去哪
Where do you think you're going?

155
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:13,470
你得换个律师
You're gonna need another lawyer.

156
00:05:13,470 --> 00:05:14,790
你为什么跟着我进大楼
Why did you follow me into the building?

157
00:05:14,790 --> 00:05:16,680
琼斯小姐  丢掉我的名片
Ms. Jones, lose my card.

158
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,770
我也想
I wish I could.

159
00:05:17,810 --> 00:05:19,420
听着  我走过这条路
Look, I've been down this road before.

160
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:21,310
-我知道我们要面对的是什么  -我知道你是谁
- I know what we're up against. - I know who you are.

161
00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:22,560
不  你不知道  相信我
No, you don't. Trust me.

162
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:25,640
我知道  你是地狱厨房的恶魔
Yes, I do. You're the Devil of Hell's Kitchen.

163
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:27,870
或是恶魔小子
Or Devil Boy,

164
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:28,660
不管你喜欢怎么称呼自己
or whatever it is you like to be called.

165
00:05:28,660 --> 00:05:30,310
不管你在暗示什么  我都不知道
Whatever you're insinuating, I don't have any clue.

166
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:33,040
我是个私家侦探  我会整理线索
I'm a PI. I put two and two together.

167
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:34,970
而且  你像个俄罗斯体操运动员一样
Besides, you leaping around the city

168
00:05:34,970 --> 00:05:37,370
满城到处飞檐走壁也暴露了你
like a Russian gymnast didn't exactly help.

169
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:41,750
-你没有证据  -我有  被你砸碎了
- You don't have any proof. - I did. You smashed it.

170
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:45,830
我不是威胁你  这一切都太明显了
I'm not threatening you. I'm just stating the obvious.

171
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:49,750
他们看到你战斗  看到你遮着脸
They saw you fight. How you're hiding your face.

172
00:05:49,750 --> 00:05:52,160
他们马上也能猜到了
They're two seconds away from figuring it out themselves.

173
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:54,980
-你想要什么  -没什么
- What do you want from me? - Nothing.

174
00:05:55,090 --> 00:05:57,960
我也不想跟这个古老组织有什么关系
And I want zero to do with this ancient organization.

175
00:05:57,970 --> 00:05:59,670
我只想解决我的案子
I just want to crack my case.

176
00:06:01,470 --> 00:06:02,960
从你那么急于行动的样子来看
And judging by the way you sprung into action,

177
00:06:02,970 --> 00:06:04,590
你也有同样的想法
I think you want the same thing.

178
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,800
你决定吧  默多克
Your call, Murdock.

179
00:06:37,050 --> 00:06:38,210
我叫马修
My name is Matthew.

180
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:54,910
{\an8}捍卫者联盟
第一季  第四集

181
00:08:16,610 --> 00:08:19,890
如果可以  我会抹去一切你过去的印记
I'd erase all the marks of your past, if I could.

182
00:08:28,290 --> 00:08:29,730
你的生命是新的了
Your life is new.

183
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:33,659
但很遗憾  你的身体不是
But sadly, your body is not.

184
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,760
我是这么死的吗
This is how I died?

185
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,120
别去想那个了
Don't worry about that.

186
00:08:39,990 --> 00:08:42,840
现在重要的是  你如何活
All that matters now is how you live.

187
00:08:46,070 --> 00:08:47,380
黑空
The Black Sky.

188
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,880
那是我的全部吗
This is all I am?

189
00:08:55,150 --> 00:08:57,130
你说得好像那还不够
You say that like it's not enough.

190
00:08:58,610 --> 00:08:59,590
不是的
