00:33:13,540 --> 00:33:15,130
我更喜欢它跟我并肩作战
I liked it better on my side of the fight

554
00:33:15,130 --> 00:33:16,500
而不是打在我脸上
and not the side of my face.

555
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:19,310
是啊  我也是
Yeah, me too.

556
00:33:21,730 --> 00:33:23,090
别太习惯了
Don't get too used to it.

557
00:33:24,300 --> 00:33:25,030
什么
What?

558
00:33:26,500 --> 00:33:29,700
-我们是个好团队  -别用那个词
- We make quite a team. - Oh, let's not use that word.

559
00:33:30,730 --> 00:33:31,600
什么词
What word?

560
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:35,780
听着  我并不想结交超级朋友
Look, I'm not looking for super friends.

561
00:33:36,230 --> 00:33:38,990
是啊  你继续那么骗自己吧
Yeah, you keep on telling yourself that.

562
00:33:40,250 --> 00:33:42,070
你去中城圈是有原因的
You came to Midland Circle for a reason.

563
00:33:42,570 --> 00:33:45,230
我去是为了帮助哈莱姆  不是你
I came to help Harlem. Not you.

564
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:48,480
得了  我才不需要帮助
Come on. I didn't need help.

565
00:33:49,180 --> 00:33:50,230
不是吧
You serious?

566
00:33:50,230 --> 00:33:54,560
听着  我只是说  不论如何
Look, all I'm saying is, like it or not...

567
00:33:55,810 --> 00:33:57,290
我们在走同一条路
we're walking the same path.

568
00:33:58,150 --> 00:34:03,000
我们一起解决这件事  那条路就到头了
We fix this thing together. Then that path comes to an end.

569
00:34:12,370 --> 00:34:13,230
最后一个
Last one?

570
00:34:41,770 --> 00:34:43,679
我很高兴你找到了其他人
I'm glad you found others.

571
00:34:44,420 --> 00:34:46,010
别假装这很正常
Don't act like this is normal.

572
00:34:47,870 --> 00:34:51,090
别假装我不知道你究竟怎么回事
Don't act like I don't know what's really going on with you.

573
00:34:54,199 --> 00:34:56,290
你也遭遇她了吧
You crossed paths with her, too?

574
00:34:56,909 --> 00:34:57,730
谁
With who?

575
00:34:58,260 --> 00:35:01,590
别骗我  艾丽卡
Don't bullshit me. Elektra.

576
00:35:03,080 --> 00:35:03,990
你怎么知道的
How'd you know?

577
00:35:04,330 --> 00:35:05,600
我了解你  孩子
I know you, son.

578
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:10,180
-她是你来的唯一原因  -她还活着  棍叟
- She's the only reason you're here. - She's alive, Stick.

579
00:35:10,850 --> 00:35:12,130
不  不是的
No, she's not.

580
00:35:12,860 --> 00:35:14,380
她已经不是她了
She's something else.

581
00:35:15,730 --> 00:35:17,460
你没在他们面前提她
You didn't mention her in front of them.

582
00:35:18,560 --> 00:35:19,900
你也没有
Neither did you.

583
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,870
看来她是我们的小秘密
Guess she's our little secret.

584
00:35:23,870 --> 00:35:25,350
我听不到她的心跳
I couldn't hear her heartbeat.

585
00:35:25,750 --> 00:35:29,900
那是因为我训练的女孩  你爱的女人
That's 'cause the girl I trained, the woman you loved...

586
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:32,320
已经不在了
she ain't there anymore.

587
00:35:32,320 --> 00:35:34,480
-或许我们能帮她  -不  我们不能
- Maybe we can help her. - No, we can't.

588
00:35:34,730 --> 00:35:37,320
他们复活她时  抹去了她的记忆
When they brought her back, they made her forget.

589
00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:38,050
不
No.

590
00:35:39,540 --> 00:35:40,750
她犹豫了
She hesitated.

591
00:35:41,560 --> 00:35:44,180
她没杀我  她有机会的
She didn't kill me. She had... She had the chance.

592
00:35:44,180 --> 00:35:46,690
别去寻找解释
Don't try to make sense of this.

593
00:35:47,250 --> 00:35:50,850
因为不管你帮不帮忙  等时候到了
'Cause with you or without you, when the time comes...

594
00:35:51,110 --> 00:35:54,980
艾丽卡·纳齐丝身体里的不管是什么东西
whatever is living inside the body of Elektra Natchios

595
00:35:54,980 --> 00:35:56,620
都得死
is gonna have to die.

596
00:36:01,460 --> 00:36:02,970
你也听到了吗
You hear what I hear?

597
00:36:05,860 --> 00:36:07,100
外面有人
Someone's outside.

598
00:36:25,570 --> 00:36:28,310
天呐  只有我不会空手道吗
Jesus, am I the only one left who doesn't know karate?

599
00:36:31,340 --> 00:36:33,950
这个家庭已经经受了很多
This family has been through enough.

600
00:36:34,270 --> 00:36:36,950
不管她丈夫做了什么  她什么都不知道
Whatever her husband did, she doesn't know anything.

601
00:36:36,950 --> 00:36:39,580
她不是威胁  那孩子也不是
She's not a threat, and neither is the kid.

602
00:36:39,890 --> 00:36:41,410
听懂了就点头
Nod if you understand me.

603
00:36:42,900 --> 00:36:44,770
你会不再来打扰她们就点头
Now nod if you're gonna leave them alone.

604
00:36:50,560 --> 00:36:52,110
我说清楚吧
Let me make this very clear.

605
00:36:55,480 --> 00:36:56,310
他说了什么
What'd he say?

606
00:36:58,630 --> 00:37:00,150
那是什么语言
What language is that?

607
00:37:03,450 --> 00:37:05,940
我不是黑带  如果疼你说一声
I'm no black belt. You let me know when that hurts.

608
00:37:10,570 --> 00:37:12,700
待在这里  锁上门
Stay back there. Lock the door.

609
00:37:21,150 --> 00:37:22,160
你觉得是他们吗
You think it's them?

610
00:37:25,850 --> 00:37:26,850
不好说
It's hard to tell.

611
00:37:28,190 --> 00:37:29,430
他们怎么找到我们的
How'd they find us?

612
00:37:30,510 --> 00:37:32,030
迟早的事
It was a matter of time.

613
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:33,940
里面是谁
Who's inside?

614
00:37:35,720 --> 00:37:36,530
武器
Weapons.

615
00:37:37,200 --> 00:37:38,870
几把枪  上满了膛
Couple of guns, fully loaded.

616
00:37:39,360 --> 00:37:40,410
那个拿剑的女人呢
How about the woman with the swords?

617
00:37:40,410 --> 00:37:43,410
我不知道  我分辨不出来
I don't know. I can't... I can't tell.

618
00:37:45,990 --> 00:37:48,410
我的天
Well, I'll be goddamned.

619
00:37:49,460 --> 00:37:51,340
这不会是我的第一选择
This wouldn't be my first choice,

620
00:37:51,340 --> 00:37:53,620
但我就喜欢幸运饼干
but I am a sucker for fortune cookies.

621
00:37:54,220 --> 00:37:56,070
我觉得我们应该
You know, I thought it would be a good idea

622
00:37:56,070 --> 00:37:58,120
好好谈谈
if we all talked this over...

623
00:37:59,380 --> 00:38:00,480
像成年人那样
like adults.

624
00:38:01,830 --> 00:38:02,960
你想要什么
What do you want?

625
00:38:04,890 --> 00:38:06,520
你让我意外  棍叟
You surprised me, Stick.

626
00:38:06,950 --> 00:38:10,380
你老了却这么机智
You've become so resourceful in your old age.

627
00:38:12,260 --> 00:38:14,070
那你老了变成了什么
What have you become in yours?

628
00:38:14,190 --> 00:38:15,270
坚定
Determined.

629
00:38:16,780 --> 00:38:19,890
兰德先生  很遗憾你如此突然地
Mr. Rand, I'm sorry your exit from our meeting

630
00:38:19,890 --> 00:38:21,320
离开了我们的会面
was so abrupt.

631
00:38:21,330 --> 00:38:22,560
你企图杀我们
You tried to kill us.

632
00:38:23,830 --> 00:38:25,940
或许是想杀他们  但你不会
Them maybe. Not you.

633
00:38:26,610 --> 00:38:29,630
我的组织一直很尊重
My organization has always had a great deal of respect

634
00:38:29,630 --> 00:38:31,430
昆仑的保护者
for the protector of K'un-Lun.

635
00:38:31,430 --> 00:38:33,320
你的尊重对我毫无意义
Your respect means nothing to me.

636
00:38:34,090 --> 00:38:36,520
我唯一的目的就是扳倒你们
My only purpose is to take you down.

637
00:38:36,740 --> 00:38:39,660
但你一次次没能实现
Something you've repeatedly failed to do.

638
00:38:40,430 --> 00:38:43,480
或许该考虑其他选择了
Perhaps it's time to consider some alternatives.

639
00:38:43,560 --> 00:38:45,350
没有其他选择
There are no alternatives.

640
00:38:45,820 --> 00:38:48,170
亲爱的  选择总是有的
Darling, there are always alternatives.

641
00:38:48,840 --> 00:38:50,720
所以生活才如此有趣
That's what makes life interesting.

642
00:38:51,840 --> 00:38:53,840
少废话了  亚历山德拉
Cut the shit, Alexandra.

643
00:38:54,730 --> 00:38:57,880
-你想要什么  -我一直想要的东西
- What do you want? - The same thing I've always wanted.

644
00:38:58,230 --> 00:39:00,160
让光照向黑暗
To bring light into the dark.

645
00:39:00,260 --> 00:39:02,960
让生命来到死亡之间
To bring life where there is death.

646
00:39:03,640 --> 00:39:08,020
你口上说生命  却杀了那么多人
For all your talk of life, you sure kill a lot of people.

647
00:39:16,470 --> 00:39:19,400
我们好像还没正式介绍过
I don't think we've been properly introduced.

648
00:39:22,080 --> 00:39:23,540
那就别了
Let's keep it that way.

649
00:39:27,840 --> 00:39:31,460
我看得出你们形成了一种纽带
I can see you've formed a kind of bond here.

650
00:39:31,810 --> 00:39:33,710
这虽然能给你们些安慰
And while that might give you some comfort,

651
00:39:33,710 --> 00:39:35,580
但我保证  那只是一时的
I promise you, it's temporary.

652
00:39:37,140 --> 00:39:38,840
他们会让你失望
They will disappoint you.

653
00:39:40,280 --> 00:39:41,250
他们现在还没呢
They haven't yet.

654
00:39:41,940 --> 00:39:43,890
他们不会让你更加强大
They will not make you stronger.

655
00:39:44,090 --> 00:39:46,380
容我给你一句建议
And if I might give you some advice,

656
00:39:46,560 --> 00:39:48,710
你的羁绊越多
the more connections you have,

657
00:39:49,030 --> 00:39:51,410
你越容易被打倒
the easier it will be to break you.

658
00:39:51,940 --> 00:39:53,740
你想对他做什么
What do you want to do with him?

659
00:39:54,040 --> 00:39:55,810
这我不能说
Well, I can't disclose that.

660
00:39:56,810 --> 00:39:59,190
但我可以说我愿为他做什么
But I'll tell you what I'm willing to do for him.

661
00:40:00,070 --> 00:40:04,280
我会汇集我组织的一切资源
I'll assemble all the resources my organization has to offer.

662
00:40:04,810 --> 00:40:06,550
你记得上次
You remember the last time

663
00:40:06,860 --> 00:40:11,350
手和会的所有手指聚集在一起的时候吧  棍叟
all the fingers of the Hand came together, don't you, Stick?

664
00:40:12,150 --> 00:40:13,930
一次大筛选
A goddamn culling.

665
00:40:16,010 --> 00:40:19,850
纽约是个人口如此密集的地方
And New York is so densely populated.

666
00:40:20,250 --> 00:40:21,990
你在说什么
What are you talking about doing?

667
00:40:23,200 --> 00:40:27,780
想想看如果你跟我走  能救下多少生命
Think of how many lives you can save if you just come with me.

668
00:40:28,580 --> 00:40:29,500
你想要什么
What do you want?

669
00:40:30,520 --> 00:40:33,470
孩子  想都别想
Kid, don't even think about it.

670
00:40:33,470 --> 00:40:34,930
我只想要答案
I just want an answer.

671
00:40:35,480 --> 00:40:37,520
我甚至可以放走他们
I might even let them go free.

672
00:40:38,410 --> 00:40:40,040
你跟她走
You walk with her...

673
00:40:40,690 --> 00:40:42,670
我就亲手干掉你
and I'll take you out myself.

674
00:40:42,670 --> 00:40:44,110
我哪都不会去
I'm not going anywhere.

675
00:40:45,010 --> 00:40:46,180
兰德先生
Mr. Rand...

676
00:40:47,250 --> 00:40:48,880
你得想清楚
you need to think this through.

677
00:40:50,080 --> 00:40:51,560
你得走了
And you need to leave.

678
00:40:53,070 --> 00:40:53,820
马上
Now.

679
00:41:07,920 --> 00:41:09,620
他们跟你一样  老头子
They're just like you, old man.

680
00:41:10,260 --> 00:41:13,390
他们唯一会说的语言  就是暴力
The only language they speak is violence.

681
00:41:39,780 --> 00:41:41,220
来吧  我的孩子
Go on, my child.

682
00:41:42,390 --> 00:41:43,840
效力生命本身
Serve life itself.

683
00:42:30,430 --> 00:42:31,370
有谁想我了吗
Who missed me?

